    <DataNode elementId="AT4G11600-MONOMER" textLabel="AT4G11600-MONOMER" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="AT4G11600.1" dataSource="TAIR gene name" />
      <Graphics centerX="150" centerY="395" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The cDNA encoding phospholipid hydroperoxide glutathione peroxidase (PHGPX) that catalyzes the reduction of hydroperoxides of phospholipids has been identified in &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt;. The expression pattern of the gene under NaCl and Al/Fe stress was investigated. The 3 and 4.5 times higher expression, respectively was indicative for a response of the gene to oxidative stress |CITS:[9511228]|. The gene encodes mitochondrial and cytosolic isoforms by alternative initiation and is expressed throughout development in most tissues |CITS:[14617062]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT4G11600-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Araport" value="AT4G11600.1" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pid" value="BAA24226" />
